# Signed driver bundle — NEVER EOL-normalize. With core.autocrlf=true, git
# rewrites the .inf line endings on checkout, which changes its hash and breaks
# the catalog signature -> ERROR_FILE_HASH_NOT_IN_CATALOG (0xE000024B) at driver
# bind. The .cat is signed over these exact bytes, so they must round-trip verbatim.
* -text
*.inf -text
*.cat -text binary
*.dll -text binary
*.cer -text binary
